{% include 'header.liquid' %}

<section id="landing">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="landing-content">
      <h1>
        The reporting platform
        that puts <span class="text-aero">innovation</span>
        first
      </h1>
      <p>
        Spending too much time on administration, version control and compliance? The Growth Portal offers a streamlined
        environment for financial and content-based reporting of consortium projects.
      </p>
      <div class="landing-buttons">
        <a href="#features" class="btn btn-outline">Discover more</a>
        <a href="https://bronscode.nl/contact" class="btn">Book a demo</a>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-partners">
        <span>Powered by</span>
        <div>
          <a class="landing-partners-bc" href="https://bronscode.nl" target="_blank">
            {% include 'img/bronscode_logo.svg' %}
          </a>
          <a class="landing-partners-ngf" href="https://nxtgenhightech.nl" target="_blank">
            {% include 'img/nxtgen_logo.svg' %}
          </a>
          <a class="landing-partners-ngf" href="https://toekomstbestendigeleefomgeving.nl" target="_blank">
            {% include 'img/tbl_logo.svg' %}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-images">
      <img class="landing-images-front" src="/img/nxtgen_screenshot_1.png">
      <img class="landing-images-back" src="/img/nxtgen_screenshot_0.png">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="features">
  <h2>Key features</h2>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="feature">
      {% include "img/icons-flow.svg" %}
      <h3>Seamless reporting flow</h3>
      <p>
        Budgets, results, reviews and feedback — all brought together in one intuitive interface.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      {% include "img/icons-xhair.svg" %}
      <h3>Meaningful KPIs</h3>
      <p>
        Easily collect both financial and content data to get a clear overview of KPIs across every active project.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      {% include "img/icons-chart.svg" %}
      <h3>Progress tracking</h3>
      <p>
        Instantly see which projects are on track — and which need attention — so you can act where it matters most.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      {% include "img/icons-align.svg" %}
      <h3>Powerful dashboards</h3>
      <p>
        Portfolio-wide dashboards with real-time statistics give you full control and oversight.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="gains">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Why choose the Growth Portal?</h2>
    <div class="gains-grid">
      <div class="gains-content">
        <p>
          <b class="text-aero">For participants</b><br>
          Innovators want to focus on creating, not on paperwork. Annual reports and administration shouldn’t slow down progress.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Growth Portal simplifies reporting, saving time and freeing up energy for what really matters: <b>innovation</b>.
        </p>
        <p>
          <b class="text-aero">For coordinators</b><br>
          To get the best out of innovation projects, coordinators need reliable insight into progress and partner contributions.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Growth Portal provides a crystal-clear <b>overview</b> of financial reports and progress updates, so project leaders always stay ahead.
        </p>
        <p>
          <b class="text-aero">For management</b><br>
          Management must demonstrate real impact: social, economic and environmental.  
          Transparent, evidence-based reporting builds trust with funders and stakeholders.
        </p>
        <p>
          By consolidating data across all levels of your portfolio, the Growth Portal delivers a reliable, up-to-date picture that enables management to present impact <b>with confidence</b>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="gains-icons">
        <div class="gains-icon">
          {% include "img/icons-clock.svg" %}
          <h4>Save time</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="gains-icon">
          {% include "img/icons-error.svg" %}
          <h4>Reduce errors</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="gains-icon">
          {% include "img/icons-server.svg" %}
          <h4>Single source of truth</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="gains-icon">
          {% include "img/icons-roles.svg" %}
          <h4>Role-based access</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="gains-icon">
          {% include "img/icons-gauge.svg" %}
          <h4>Measure performance</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="gains-icon">
          {% include "img/icons-atom.svg" %}
          <h4>Show impact</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-arrow" href="cases">Explore case studies</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="stats" class="fade-in">
  <h2>Trusted by:</h2>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-amount">
        <span class="stat-number animate" data-target="84">0</span>
      </div>
      <span class="stat-caption">projects</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-amount">
        <span class="stat-number animate" data-target="500">0</span><span style="display:inline-block;" class="stat-plus">+</span>
      </div>
      <span class="stat-caption">project partners</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-amount">
        <span class="euro">€</span><span class="stat-number animate" data-target="1.2" data-precision="1">0</span>B
      </div>
      <span class="stat-caption">reported value</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="growth">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>We <span class="text-aero">grow</span> with you</h1>
    <p>
      The Growth Portal adapts to your organization, no matter the structure.  
      We support smooth rollouts, including migration of historical data, and provide ongoing guidance and support.
    </p>
    <p>
      And as your needs evolve, the Growth Portal evolves with you — expanding and scaling in the right direction.
    </p>
    <a href="https://bronscode.nl/contact" class="btn">Book an intro call</a>
  </div>
</section>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/index.css" />
<script type="text/javascript" src="/js/index.js" async></script>

{% include 'footer.liquid' %}
